WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.400
Your sign-ins live on a small USB key.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.800
Two designs. Tiny, or shaped like a key.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.200
The key has no button. You approve on screen.

4
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.300
It fills the password or signs a passkey.
You still press Sign in.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
It signs you in to your PC, too.
